    "text": "For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo></math>, the number of solutions of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
